= Domain portal =

Reusable navigation shell for V2 domain portals.

<pre>
{{Domain portal
 |title=Biology
 |domain=Biology
 |category=Biology
 |description=Entry point for living systems...
 |start=[[Cell membrane]] — compact domain exemplar
 |tree=<categorytree mode="pages" depth="2">Biology</categorytree>
 |related=[[Portal:Science|Science]] · [[Portal:Medicine|Medicine]]
}}
</pre>

The template supplies navigation mechanics only. Domain-specific orientation and cross-domain relationships remain explicit on each portal.

The semantic table queries the [[Property:Domain|Domain]] property rather than treating category membership as ontology. The category remains a complementary human browse surface.

[[Category:BITwiki templates]]
</noinclude>
